    <Name>INT_2015_0060</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0060","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>On the shadow of a canvas that was never painted</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0060","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2015-01-05</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0060","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Jules Achterberg talks about triangles as a form of apology. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
