          <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"person","folderId":"Jules Achterberg","fieldKey":"description"} -->
          <Description>Jules Achterberg belongs to Frameless Expressionism and works in the artist's kitchen. Asked about influences, Jules Achterberg said only "a square that refuses to be a square".</Description>
